            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela babaandu bewe ali, “Nga enywe ne mwakholwa nasioobi se chiliio chirupia nicho enywe mwakulwa tawe, ne mu ngila ng'ene se siliio siikharuungwe khumulekhuula tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami WELE aloma ali, nga ne mwacha khumenya mu Misiri nga baakwa, mwakhola murio mu khwenya khwenywe mwabeene, kakhaba kario Ashuru siamubukula siamuyila ne kamaani, mala se siaruunga sisiindu siosi siosi khulwe enywe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.2.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bar. 2.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ne luno kekholekhe kario mu Babiloni muli baambe mbao sisiaruungwa khulwe enywe tawe. Abo bamwamiia bebonia ne khukhwiniinia ne buli lwosi bandekelesia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu siise siliicha mulifukiilila muli ese ndi Wele lundi niise olomalome nanywe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
